OL,3,GNEWSAStabbing victim 'loved and
OL,4,Arespected by friends'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was stabbed to death in a
OL,7,Fpark was "loved and respected", his
OL,8,Ffamily have said.
OL,10,FZherko Rasul Osman, 24, suffered
OL,11,Fserious stab wounds on Chapel Street in
OL,12,Fthe Levenshulme area of Manchester just
OL,13,Fafter 19:00 BST on Saturday and died at
OL,14,Fthe scene, Greater Manchester Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FA 23-year-old man, who was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of murder on Tuesday, remains
OL,19,Fin custody.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
