OL,3,GNEWSAStabbing victim 'loved and
OL,4,Arespected by friends'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute, Osman's brother described
OL,7,Fhim as "a kind, friendly and loving
OL,8,Fperson who never looked for trouble or
OL,9,Fwanted to harm anyone".
